  "content": "<p>---------------------Английский-----------------------------------</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Этот</a>&nbsp;модпак&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">является</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252finspired\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">вдохновлённым</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">работой</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fkilling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">убийством</a>&nbsp;монстров,&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fnot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">а не</a>&nbsp;машинами&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252for\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">или</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fanything\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">чем-либо</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252felse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">другим</a>.<br>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Мы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fmade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">создали</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">его</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">с помощью</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">этого</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fintention\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">намерения</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">вас</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252ffun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">развлечься</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">игрой</a>!&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Оно</a>'<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">s</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252funfortunately\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">к сожалению</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fnot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">не</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">то</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252flightweight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">лёгкий</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fso\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">поэтому</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">мы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fexpect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ожидаем</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fyou\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">от вас</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">чтобы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fallocate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">выделили</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">по крайней мере</a>&nbsp;6 ГБ&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">оперативной памяти</a> для размещения сервера, однако для игры в одиночном режиме можно использовать только 4 ГБ.</p><p>Создатели: Cascalho_&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">и</a> zMoonszz</p><p>Помощники: Victorgsc_<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Мы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">являемся</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">всеми</a>&nbsp;бразильцами&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fbut\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">но</a> zMoonszz говорит <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fenglish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">по-английски</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">если</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fyou\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">у вас</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fany\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">есть</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252ffor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">вопросы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fyou\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">для вас</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">кто</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fdon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">не</a>'<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252ft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">т</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fspeak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">говорит</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fportuguese\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">по-португальски</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">связаться</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fhim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">с ним</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252for\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">или</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">один</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">из</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252four\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">наших</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fstaff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">сотрудников</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">на</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">этом</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">дискорде</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fserver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">сервере</a>! <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Модпак</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">будет</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">обновлен</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fevery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">каждые</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fweekend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">выходные</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">если</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fwe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">мы</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fsee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">увидим</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fthat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">что</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fsomething\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">что-то</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">есть</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fmissing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">отсутствует</a>.<br><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Дискорд</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdictionary.cambridge.org%252fdictionary%252fenglish-portuguese%252fserver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Сервер</a>: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/eNpd9XNMdq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/eNpd9XNMdq</a><br>----------------------По-португальски---------------------------<br><br></p><p>Этот модпак вдохновлён убийством мобов, а не машин или чего-то другого. Мы создали его с мыслью, чтобы вам было весело играть в него! К сожалению, он не очень лёгкий, поэтому мы рекомендуем выделить как минимум 6 ГБ оперативной памяти для средней производительности; если же вы собираетесь играть в одиночку, можно обойтись и 4 ГБ.</p><p>Создатели: Cascalho_ и zMoonszz</p><p>Помощники: Victorgsc_</p><p>Все мы бразильцы. Если у вас возникнут вопросы, используйте чат на бразильском языке для связи — мы всегда начеку <3&nbsp; &nbsp; Модпак будет обновляться каждые выходные, если мы заметим, что чего-то не хватает.</p><p>Сервер Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/eNpd9XNMdq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/eNpd9XNMdq</a></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></p>",
